# Replaces stow's built-in ignore list, for this package only.
#
# .cloudflare_env is a machine-local secrets helper: gitignored, and linked into
# $HOME by hand as an absolute symlink. Stow refuses to adopt a target it does
# not own, and one such conflict aborts the *whole* package -- which is how
# .db_aliases and .runpod_aliases sat in this directory unlinked for months.
\.cloudflare_env
\.stow-local-ignore
